{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52611","headline":"示智通偈 · 慧能","name":"示智通偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大圆镜智性清净，平等性智心无病，妙观察智见非功，成所作智同圆镜。\n五八六七果因转，但用名言无实性。\n若於转处不留情，繁兴永处那伽定。\n（契嵩本《六祖大师法宝坛经》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}